### ===================================================
### BROTAR API - PRUEBAS DE ENDPOINTS (USERS & AUTH)
### Extensión recomendada: "REST Client" o "Thunder Client"
### ===================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Test Health / Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTH: Registrar un nuevo creador (CREATOR)
# @name registerCreator
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.flores@ecoverde.bo",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "fullName": "Ana Flores",
  "role": "creator",
  "phone": "+591 71234567"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 3. AUTH: Registrar un Administrador (ADMIN)
# @name registerAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin.ana@brotar.bo",
  "password": "AdminPassword123!",
  "fullName": "Ana Delgado",
  "role": "sponsor",
  "phone": "+591 70000001"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 4. AUTH: Iniciar Sesión (Login)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana.flores@ecoverde.bo",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Guardar Token de la respuesta
@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@targetUserId = {{login.response.body.user.id}}

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 5. USERS: Obtener mi perfil autenticado (GET /users/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 6. USERS: Listar todos los usuarios con filtros (Solo Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?role=creator&kycStatus=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 7. USERS: Obtener usuario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------
### 8. USERS: Actualizar Estado KYC a Verificado (Solo Admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/kyc-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kycStatus": "verified"
}
